    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a wizard named Wander. Once full of big dreams, Wander tried to save the world with magic and....... failed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retired from saving the world. Now just saving up for rent by running his dad\u2019s old cafe in his village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the village isn\u2019t quite as peaceful as he remembers. A strange fog something like a brainmist clouds the minds of the townspeople.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe it\u2019s time for Wander to give magic one more shot. Maybe the coffee needs a little more than just milk and sugar?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew spells! Learn from the wizard cat, Limon. Discover new magic from enchanted forest creatures. Free the villagers from the brain mist and become Magemist!\u00a0At the end remember, you are the Wanderer above the Sea of Fog....</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a wizard named Wander. Once full of big dreams, Wander tried to save the world with magic and....... failed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retired from saving the world. Now just saving up for rent by running his dad\u2019s old cafe in his village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the village isn\u2019t quite as peaceful as he remembers. A strange fog something like a brainmist clouds the minds of the townspeople.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe it\u2019s time for Wander to give magic one more shot. Maybe the coffee needs a little more than just milk and sugar?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew spells! Learn from the wizard cat, Limon. Discover new magic from enchanted forest creatures. Free the villagers from the brain mist and become Magemist!\u00a0At the end remember, you are the Wanderer above the Sea of Fog....</p>",
